   "textLength": 427,
   "text": "What does grandparenting look like today? Insight explores whether the demands on modern-day grandparents are keeping them physically fit and mentally well, or if the younger generations' wants and needs are being prioritised to the detriment of grandparents. Watch Insight episode Grandparenting on SBS On Demand.\nMatt:\nI love telling people I'm a grandfather at 39, then immediately stopping to lea",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
