   "class": "bodyParagaph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 403,
   "text": "Their eyes widen, and you see them do calculations in their head — wondering if they should ask the follow-up question: \"How old were you when you had your first child?\"\nAfter a few seconds, I explain how my wife and I met when I was 18, and she was 22 and already had a three-year-old, Ethan. And Ethan and his wife, Maddy, had a child named Illyria when he was 22 years old — almost two years ago n",
