   "textLength": 444,
   "text": "At times, I feel like I'm leading a double life.\nOne minute, I'm doing school pickup or coaching our second son Zander's U12 rugby team.\nThe next, my wife Esther asks if I remembered to put our two-year-old granddaughter Illyria's car seat in the car to pick her up for a sleepover.\nWe threw all our baby stuff out the moment our youngest Eden was too big for it five years ago. We weren't expecting ",
