   "textLength": 500,
   "text": "But being a young grandparent brought a feeling I never expected: guilt.\nArguably, most older grandparents have children who are all grown up and they are retired — or close to it — and have the free time to put more energy into their grandchildren.\nAnd sometimes, I feel a pang of jealousy for these older grandparents. I'm not jealous because it's a competition, but because they're at a stage of l",
