   "text": "There are benefits to being a younger grandparent, though.\nWe have more energy (we like to think) and remember what it was like to have a baby in the house. I mean, it was only six years ago that Eden, 9, was a toddler.\nShe and our granddaughter absolutely adore each other, and their relationship is somewhat unconventional, with just a seven-year age gap.\nEden is known as 'Yaunty' (young aunty), a",
