   "text": "And watching our 23-year-old Ethan become a dad has been the next best thing to becoming one myself.\nHe's not just attentive as a father, but he gives his heart fully to his wife and daughters. (I should mention they've just had another baby, Ananyah, who is one week old as I write this.)\nHe and I were extremely close when he was little, and we had a bit more distance when he was a teenager, becom",
