  },
  {
   "index": 26,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "class": "bodyParagaph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 471,
   "text": "I have always believed that everything happens for a reason. If my purpose was simply to be his mum, then that was enough — and I was going to give it everything I had.\nEthan and I were a tight-knit duo, and after recently being dumped, I was even more determined to prove I could navigate motherhood and life as a single woman.\nBut right when my career and independence were about to take off, I met",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 3,
