  {
   "index": 27,
   "tag": "h2",
   "class": "rich-text EmbeddedHeadings-module__7e6F-a__heading override-heading-font",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 16,
   "text": "A natural parent",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 1,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 0,
    "repeats": 1,
    "coverLinks": 0
   },
   "linkTextRatio": 0,
   "geometry": {
    "top": 6352,
    "height": 42,
    "widthFraction": 0.47,
    "leftFraction": 0.28,
    "pageFraction": 0.65,
    "aboveFold": false
   }
  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "tag": "p×3",
   "class": "bodyParagaph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 367,
   "text": "Neither of us thought it would go anywhere; he was 18, and I was a 22-year-old single mum to a three-year-old.\nWe also had eight weeks before we were both moving to different cities for work, so we spent as much of that time together as we could.\nAfter six weeks, we both knew we were in trouble and decided to be together and try having a long-distance relationship.",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
    "paragraphs": 3,
