  {
   "index": 30,
   "tag": "p×5",
   "class": "bodyParagaph",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 619,
   "text": "Matt met Ethan after three months, and they hit it off immediately.\nI had told him Ethan already had wonderful male role models in his life and that any relationship between them could develop naturally, without labels.\nBut it quickly became obvious that Matt naturally parented Ethan and that he was falling in love with my son.\nI knew he loved kids and wanted a bigger family. Eventually, he simply",
   "counts": {
    "links": 0,
    "images": 0,
    "headings": 0,
    "listItems": 0,
    "tableRows": 0,
    "controls": 0,
